MODULE: NoLostWaiterCancelKeepsRegistration
TARGET: NoLostWaiter
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: cancel settles the caller but leaves its registration queued
PERTURBS: Cancel

--- FIND
Cancel(c) ==
    /\ outcome[c] = "parked"
    /\ parked' = [p \in Partitions |-> Remove(parked[p], c)]
    /\ outcome' = [outcome EXCEPT ![c] = "cancelled"]
    /\ waitLeft' = [waitLeft EXCEPT ![c] = 0]
    /\ callLeft' = [callLeft EXCEPT ![c] = 0]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<inflight, state, acuteCause, faultPhase, recovery, home,
        phase, cursor, refusalState>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: cancel settles the caller but leaves its registration queued
Cancel(c) ==
    /\ outcome[c] = "parked"
    /\ parked' = [p \in Partitions |-> parked[p]]
    /\ outcome' = [outcome EXCEPT ![c] = "cancelled"]
    /\ waitLeft' = [waitLeft EXCEPT ![c] = 0]
    /\ callLeft' = [callLeft EXCEPT ![c] = 0]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<inflight, state, acuteCause, faultPhase, recovery, home,
        phase, cursor, refusalState>>
--- END
